      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "随机战利品既可能产出超强装备也可能只是垃圾，并偶尔出现稀有唯一物",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Kit out your hero using a random loot generator that can and will create supercharged items (or vendor trash, you never know!), with a rare unique every now and then. All completely customizable to boot!",
